  description: '"Fallen of Albaz" + 6 monsters in your GY with different names

    Must
    first be Fusion Summoned. Can attack all your opponent''s monsters, once each.
    Cannot declare an attack unless you send 1 card from your Extra Deck to the GY.
    Once per turn, if you control this Fusion Summoned card and have 6 or more Fusion
    Monsters in your GY with different names that mention "Fallen of Albaz" as material:
    You can send all cards in each player''s Extra Deck to the GY.'
